2026-09-16 15:47:53,753 | INFO | agent.py | MCP CLIENT | raw result | meta=None content=[TextContent(type='text', text='{\n  "query": "nearest railway station to Hampi",\n  "results": [\n    {\n      "title": "Hampi (town) - Wikipedia",\n      "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hampi_(town)",\n      "snippet": "2 days ago - Hampi or Hampe (ಹಂಪೆ) is situated on the banks of the Tungabhadra River, amid rocky hills. It is 348 kilometres (216 mi) from Bangalore, 385 kilometres (239 mi) from Hyderabad and 266 kilometres (165 mi) from Belgaum. The closest railway station is in the city of Hospet (Hosapete), ..."\n    },\n    {\n      "title": "Nearest Railway Station to Hampi- Station Code, Facilities & More",\n      "url": "https://blog.travelkhana.com/rail-info/nearest-railway-station-hampi/",\n      "snippet": "March 25, 2026 - Looking for the nearest railway station to Hampi? If you’re planning a trip to Hampi, it’s important to note that there is no direct railway station in Hampi itself. The closest railway junction is Hospet Junction (officially known as Hosapete Junction), which is located around 13 kilometers ..."\n    },\n    {\n      "title": "Hyderabad to Hampi by Train",\n      "url": "https://hampi.in/hyderabad-to-hampi-by-train",\n      "snippet": "Hampi is located near the Hosapete railway station · [#train]Hosapete Jn is the nearest railway station for Hampi, a town about 14km from Hampi village."\n    },\n    {\n      "title": "Which is the nearest railway station to Hampi? - Traveler Food Blog",\n      "url": "https://www.travelerfood.com/blog/which-is-the-nearest-railway-station-to-hampi-2/",\n      "snippet": "November 12, 2025 - Hampi is nearest to the railway station, 13km from Hospet Junction, which has good connectivity to the major Indian cities. Travelling in Hampi by the train is not only a cost-effective, but also a picturesque and relaxing experience."\n    },\n    {\n      "title": "TRIP TO HAMPI - Tripoto",\n      "url": "https://www.tripoto.com/karnataka/trips/trip-to-hampi-5eb2b3feb5ed6",\n      "snippet": "As I had holidays, I went to Hampi, which is not so far from the Secunderabad. Here I am going to share my experience of Hampi trip. I started my journey on 05/04/2019 from Secunderabad to Hospet. It is the nearest railway station to Hampi. I reserved the train ticket under tatkal quota for yashwanthpur express."\n    }\n  ]\n}', annotations=None, meta=None)] structuredContent=None isError=False
