ial for Address, Contact Number, Reviews & Ratings, Photos, Maps of Hospet Railway Station, Station Road, Hospet."\n    },\n    {\n      "title": "Hospet Jn (HPT) Railway Station: Station Code, Schedule & Train Enquiry - RailYatri",\n      "url": "https://www.railyatri.in/stations/hospet-jn-hpt",\n      "snippet": "The station code name of Hospet Jn is ‘HPT’. As part of one of the busiest and populated Indian states, Karnataka, the Hospet Jn railway station is known amongst the top hundred train ticket booking and train traveling stations of the Indian Railway."\n    }\n  ]\n}', annotations=None, meta=None)] structuredContent=None isError=False
